  aciklama:
  - "Fincan\u0131n\u0131n taban\u0131yla yan duvar\u0131n biti\u015Fti\u011Fi yerde,
    ucuna k\xFC\xE7\xFCc\xFCk nazar boncu\u011Fu ili\u015Ftirilmi\u015F bir \xE7engelli
    i\u011Fne g\xF6r\xFCyorum. Bunun neye i\u015Faret oldu\u011Funu belki az \xE7ok
    sen de tahmin edebilirsin {{isim}}? Evet, yak\u0131nda \xE7ok sevdi\u011Fin ve
    evli bir tan\u0131d\u0131\u011F\u0131ndan \"do\u011Fum\" haberi alacaks\u0131n!
    \xDCz\xFCc\xFC olan \u015Fu ki, aran\u0131zdaki mesafe ya da ko\u015Fullar dolay\u0131s\u0131yla
    bu ki\u015Filerin yan\u0131nda bulunamayaca\u011F\u0131n\u0131 hissediyorum.\n\nFincan\u0131n\u0131
    y\u0131kamad\u0131ysan, l\xFCtfen \"dudak pay\u0131\" b\xF6l\xFCm\xFCnde sa\u011F
    el i\u015Faret parma\u011F\u0131n\u0131 \u015F\xF6yle bir \xE7epe\xE7evre gezdirip
    o k\u0131sm\u0131 temizle. \xDCzerindeki negatif enerjiyi birden bire att\u0131\u011F\u0131na
    \u015Fahit olacaks\u0131n {{isim}}."
